### Game Servers API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get all servers for user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get specific server
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers/{{serverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get server provisioning status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers/{{serverId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers/{{serverId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stop a server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers/{{serverId}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restart a server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers/{{serverId}}/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a server
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers/{{serverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get server health status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers/{{serverId}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get server metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/gameservers/{{serverId}}/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
